<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 211-9 V SOUTH AFRICA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 211-9 V SOUTH AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia scored 211 for nine</p>
<p>from their 50 overs against South Africa in the fourth one-day</p>
<p>international at Kingsmead on Saturday.</p>
</text>
